15. Application of Code.- The provisions of the Code shall apply to the Froceedingsunder this Act, except in the case of juvenilei who will be dealt under the Juvenile JusticeSystem Act, 2018.
1,6. Procedure for the information which relates to the commission ofabduction or missing child.- In respect of the information which relates to the-commission of offence of abduction or missing child, an officer incharge of a policestation shall compulsory reduce it to writing by him or under hjs direction. and be rr:adover to the informant and everv such information, whether given in writing or reducec towriting as aforesaid, shall be signed by the person giving it and the substance ther,:ol'shall be entered in a book to be kept by such officer and also ensure that the requiredinformation in Schedule A to this Act, is made part of the complaint.
17. Completion of trial.- The trial under this Act shall be completed within three
months
18. Act to override other laws.- Subject to section 15, the provisions of thisAct shall have oven iding effect notwithstanding anything conlained in any other lau, 1br-the time being in force.
